/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  An ADIABATIC ammonia bed whose feed already carries ammonia, with a 10 K
  approach to equilibrium and a deliberately HOT seed.  The witness of the
  rule that the approach's DIRECTION is read from the bed's own dT = 0
  adiabatic answer, never from the seed.  See flowsheetDict.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

application   choupoSolve;
description   "An adiabatic ammonia synthesis bed fed a gas that already carries 16 % NH3 (the third bed of a staged converter), 150 bar, 10 K approach to equilibrium, seeded 80 K hotter than its answer: the engine reads the approach's SIGN from the dT = 0 adiabatic outlet it solves first, not from the seed, so the bed ends BELOW its own equilibrium whichever seed the case declares";

verbosity     3;
